### Check availability
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/availability/MOU-101?quantity=2

### Simulate an order - deduct stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "MOU-101",
  "quantity": 2,
  "referenceId": "ORD-1001",
  "performedBy": "Order Module"
}

### Simulate order cancellation - restore stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "MOU-101",
  "quantity": 2,
  "referenceId": "ORD-1001",
  "performedBy": "Order Module"
}

### Simulate returned item - restore stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/return
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "MOU-101",
  "quantity": 1,
  "referenceId": "RTN-1001",
  "performedBy": "Delivery Module"
}
